# Redirects for the components-docs-restructure un-nesting (issue #137).
#
# The generated component tree moved from `components/records/{...}` up to
# `components/{...}`. zfb's native publicDir handling (zfb 2.5.1) copies
# `public/` flat into `dist/`, and Cloudflare Workers static assets honours
# `dist/_redirects`.
#
# Do NOT add a rule for `/docs/components/records` itself — that path is
# simultaneously the OLD generated landing route and the NEW Records
# sub-index route. A redirect there would 301 a live page off the site.
/docs/components/records/records/*    /docs/components/records/:splat  301
/docs/components/records/records      /docs/components/records         301
/docs/components/records/catalog      /docs/components/catalog         301
/docs/components/records/catalog/     /docs/components/catalog/        301
/docs/components/records/integration  /docs/components/integration     301
/docs/components/records/integration/ /docs/components/integration/    301
